OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy and
OL,6,Fthundery rain in the evening will ease
OL,7,Fbut a few outbreaks of rain will
OL,8,Fcontinue overnight. Becoming breezy
OL,9,Fwith strong northwest winds over
OL,10,FBuchan.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA mainly cloudy and breezy
OL,13,Fmorning with some patchy light rain.
OL,14,FDry and bright in the afternoon with
OL,15,Fwinds becoming light.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,18,Funsettled with with showers or longer
OL,19,Fspells of rain at times but also some
OL,20,Fdrier and brighter interludes.
